VITE_BIRTHDAY_MESSAGE="As you can tell from the many phone calls and texts you receive, I miss you more than I can describe while I'm at college. I miss lying on your office floor to bug you, I miss making fun of Dad with you, and most of all, I miss playing board games with you (especially by the Christmas tree with my Christmas Classics playing). I figured I would make one of our favorite games into a website so we can play it even when we're apart. After careful consideration, I determined Razzle was the game I enjoyed beating you in the most, so that was the natural pick. I hope you enjoy playing online at least a little bit as much as the real deal, but I know nothing can compare to the living room floor, so we'll do plenty of that when I'm back home. Happy Birthday!"
